<div class="container">

<h1>PingCraft — Video Demo Walkthrough Script</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Complete 2 to 5-Minute Presentation Script &amp; Technical Explanation</p>

<div class="meta-box">
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;"><strong>Presenter:</strong> Prakrit Sangwan</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;"><strong>Target Duration:</strong> 3:30 &ndash; 4:30 Minutes</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Role:</strong> Full-Stack Developer</td>
      <td><strong>Design Identity:</strong> Industrial Editorial Design System</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Live App URL:</strong> <a href="https://pingcraft-gamma.vercel.app">https://pingcraft-gamma.vercel.app</a></td>
      <td><strong>GitHub Repo:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/Prakrit-Sangwan2402/pingcraft">pingcraft (main branch)</a></td>
    </tr>
